{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Whitelo 是一款為 iOS 而設的繪畫畫布，適合喜歡隨手塗鴉、沿線描摹、挑戰想像力繪畫題目，或需要一塊乾淨白板自由創作的人。程式提供自由繪畫、引導式創作空間與像素畫三種模式，無需註冊帳戶，作品只保存在你的裝置上。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>三種創作模式配合 65 色筆刷</h2>\n<p>開啟畫布即可隨手塗鴉或記錄靈感，另設創作空間與像素畫模式。創作空間提供「補完場景」及「沿線描摹上色」兩種引導玩法，像素畫可切換至格狀畫布輕點填色。鉛筆、麥克筆與橡皮擦各有三種筆觸大小，內建角色格與英文書寫線範本，並提供 65 色、14 個色組。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-18-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-19-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-20-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-21-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-22-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-23-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Whitelo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T12:18:29.685377+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}